 alre[41Gdy[44Gexpresses[54Gstructurally, as[71G[38;2;177;185;249mderived_from[84G[39mand [38;2;177;185;249msupersedes[39m edges. The[110Gv[112Gcabulary you loaded covers the lay[147Gr that[154Gdoesn't ne[165Gd[167Gnaming, a[177Gd leav[184Gs bare[191Gthe[195Glayer[201Gthat[206Gdoes.[2C[2B[1mLayer 0 — lineage (loaded, keep, bind properly).[22m PROV-O belongs on [3mpredicates[23m, not entities: [38;2;177;185;249mderived_from[39m→[38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasDerivedFrom[39m, [38;2;177;185;249msupersedes[39m→[38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasRevisionOf[39m, the compile run→[38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasGeneratedBy[39m.[198GNote[203G[38;2;177;185;249mmemory_edges.ontology_valid[231G[39mexists[238Gfor[242Gexactly[250Gthis[2C[1Band[7Gis[10Gnever[16Gwritten[24Gby[27G[38;2;177;185;249madd_edge()[38G[39m—[40Gthe[44Gcolumn[51Gis[54Gdead.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mLayer 1 — the arteries core ([38;2;177;185;249mart:[39m), universal, binds 1:1 to existing columns so nothing migrates.[2C[2B[22m- [38;2;177;185;249mart:Claim[39m ⊃ Fact, Decision, Preference,[45GConstraint[56G→[58Gbinds[64Gto[67G[38;2;177;185;249mpersistent.kind[39m,[84Gwhose[90Gfour[95Gvalues[102Galready[110Gexist.[2C[1B-[5G[38;2;177;185;249mart:Entity[16G[39m⊃[18Gthe[22Gcurrent[30Gthree[36Gkinds,[43Gwith[48Gsubclasses[59Gcarried[67Gin[70G[38;2;177;185;249montology_class[85G[39mrather[92Gthan[97Ga[99Gnew[103Gcolumn.[111GThe[115Glive[120Gdata[125Gshows[131Gthe[135Gthree[141Gkinds[147Gare[151Gtoo[155Gcoarse:[163G[38;2;177;185;249m/agent/route[176G[39m(an[180GHTTP[185Gendpoint)[195Gand[199G[38;2;177;185;249magent/route.py[214G[39m(the[219Gfile[224Gbehind[231Git)[235Gare[239Gtwo[243Gseparate[2C[1B  nodes both type[21G [38;2;177;185;249mmodule[39m; [38;2;177;185;249mdev-wip[39m (a [42Git[45Gbranch) is typed [38;2;177;185;249mconcept[39m; [38;2;177;185;249mArteries[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mCapillaries[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mHeart[39m,[101G[38;2;177;185;249mMarrow[108G[39mare typed [38;2;177;185;249mmodule[39m when[130Gthey are p[141Gojects. Prop[154Gsed subclasses — SoftwareModule, Service[196GDependency, Interface, Artifact, Concept,[238GAgent/P[246Grson,[K[2C[1B  Metric, Environment.[K[2C[1B-[5GRelations[15Gworth[21Gadding[28Gto[31Gthe[35Gcurrent[43Gten:[48G[38;2;177;185;249mcauses[39m,[56G[38;2;177;185;249mapplies_to[67G[39m(constraint→entity),[88G[38;2;177;185;249minvalidated_by[103G[39m([38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasInvalidatedBy[126G[39m—[128Gyou[132Gtombstone[142Gwith[147G[38;2;177;185;249mvalid_until[159G[39mbut[163Gnever[169Grecord[176G[3mwhy[23m),[182G[38;2;177;185;249mmeasured_at[39m,[195G[38;2;177;185;249malternative_to[39m.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mLayer 2 — per-scope domain vocabularies, in SKOS.[22m [38;2;177;185;249mharness[61G[39mgets[66Gthe[70Gstack's[78Gown[82Gnouns.[89G[38;2;177;185;249mcareer-ops[100G[39mgets[105Grole/company/stage/comp-band.[135G[38;2;177;185;249mTrading-Bot[147G[39mgets[152Ginstrument/position/signal/drawdown.[189GMechanism:[200G[38;2;177;185;249montology_terms.source[222G[39malready[230Gexists,[238Gso[241Gthis[246Gis[249Gone[2C[1Bsmall[9Gtable[15G—[17G[38;2;177;185;249montology_bindings(scope_id, source)[53G[39m—[55Gplus[60Ga[62Gscope[68Gfilter[75Gin[78G[38;2;177;185;249m_lookup()[39m.[89GLayers[96G0[98Gand[102G1[104Gbind[109Gto[112G[38;2;177;185;249m*[39m.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mC. What it changes, per store[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1B┌────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[K[2C[1B│[5G  Layer   [16G│    [22G       [30G       [38G  [41G   [45G       [53G  [56G     Today    [71G         [81G            [94G      [101G      [108G  │[112G     [118G      [125G    [130G    [135G   [139G         [149G        [158G          [169G [171G     After     [187G        [196G           [208G          [219G         [229G        [238G         │[K[2C[1B├────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│[13Gal │ [38;2;177;185;249mpersistent.kind[39m is f[40Ge text defaulting to [38;2;177;185;249m'fact'[39m; 147 of 157 rows are [38;2;177;185;249mfact[39m         [103G       │ Kind constrained to[132GLayer-1 classes; fine type[159Gin [38;2;177;185;249montology_class[39m     [182G            [195G               [247G│[2C[1B├────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ Graph      │ 23 entities, 0 grounded; [38;2;177;185;249mancestors()[39m never[61Gr[64Gurns anything, so[82Gsubclass expansion is inert │ [38;2;177;185;249mmetadata.ontology_ancestors[39m populates, and [38;2;177;185;249mexpand()[39m's shared-entity join reach[191Gs [194G claim about [38;2;177;185;249mpgv[211Gctor[39m from a qu[226Gry about [38;2;177;185;249mVectorStore[39m │[249G[K[2C[1B├────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│[5GVector[16G│[18G[38;2;177;185;249mentities.embedding[37G[39mis[40Gdeclared[49Gand[53G[1mnever written[110G[22m│[112GGrounding[122Gproduces[131Ga[133Gcanonical[143Gname[148Gworth[154Gembedding[164G—[166Galias[172Gcollapse[181Gcuts[186Gsynonym[194Gfragmentation[208G[3mbefore[215G[23mthe[219Gvector[226Gis[229Gcomputed[247G│[2C[1B└────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[2C[2BOne gap outranks the ontology for your stated goal of decision support: [38;2;177;185;249mchose[39m and [38;2;177;185;249mover[39m edges point at [1mliteral strings[22m, not entities ([38;2;177;185;249mcompile.py:518-524[39m), and the [38;2;177;185;249mdecisions[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mrewards[39m ledger has no edge into [38;2;177;185;249mpersistent[39m at all. Eight decision claims exist[2C[1Band[7Gnon[11G of[15Gthem[20Gcan[24Gbe[27Gaggregated[38Gor[41Gscored[48Gagainst[56Goutcome. Grounding[75Gthe[79Galternatives[92Gas[95Gentities[104Gis[107Gwhat[112Gturns[118G"what[124Gdid[128GI[130Gdecide"[138Ginto[143G"what[149Gdid[153GI[155Gdecide[162Gabout[168GX,[171Gand[175Gdid it[182Gwork."[247G[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mD. First question[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BEve[7Gyt[10Ging[14Gabove holds under one assumption I should confi[62Gm rather than [77Gue[80Gs: how many scopes th[104Ghas [109Go serve. If [38;2;177;185;249mharness[39m is the only rea[145G group, Layer 2 and the T-Box scope f[183Glter ar[191G spe[196Gulative and I'd cut[216Gthe[221Gtoday. If [38;2;177;185;249mcareer-ops[39m and[K[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mTrading-Bot[39m are joining, the filter is a prerequisite, not a nice-to-have.[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[1B[48;2;177;185;249m[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Scope roster [39m[49m[K[2B[2m│[3G[22m[38;2;255;255;255m[1mWhich project groups is this ontology actually going to serve? Right now the DB has exactly one real scope — `harness` (arteries, capillaries, marrow) — plus 270 junk /tmp rows. `heart` and `plexus` exist on disk but aren't tracked.[22m[39m[K[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;177;185;249m❯[3G[38;2;153;153;153m1.[6G[38;2;177;185;249mHarness only, all 5 repos[2C[1B[39m   [38;2;153;153;153mAdd heart and plexus to `harness`; no other project group. Cuts Layer 2 and the T-Box scope filter entirely — one shared vocabulary, no cross-contamination risk, smallest design.[2C[1B2.[6G[39mHarness[14G+[16G1-2[20Gunrelated[30Gdomains[2C[1B   [38;2;153;153;153me.g. career-ops and/or Trading-Bot join as their own scopes. Layer 2 and the ontology_bindings scope filter become prerequisites, since finance/career nouns must not resolve inside coding scopes.[39m[K[2C[1B[38;2;153;153;153m3.[39m Harness + many, growing over [36Gime[K[5C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mEvery project on disk eventually gets tracked (~20 repos, several unrelated domains). Needs Layer 2, the scope filter, plus a vocabulary authorship loop and a T-Box growth budget.[1B[39m [3G[38;2;153;153;153m4.[39m Not sure yet — design for both[K[1B     [38;2;153;153;153mBuild Layer 0/1[22Gnow and[30Gmake Lay[39Gr[41G2 a documented extension point tha[76G costs noth[89Gg until a second domain appears.[2C[1B5. Type something.[1B──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[1B[39m  6.[6GChat[11Gabout[17Gthis[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select ·[19G↑/↓ to n[28Gvigate · Esc to [45Gancel[39m[K[59;1H[47;1H[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h[?2026h[H[46B [6GHarness only, all 5 repos[2B[38;2;177;185;249m❯[6GHarness + 1-2 unrelated domains[39m[59;1H[49;1H[?2026l[?2026h[H[48B [6GHarness + 1-2 unrelated domains[2B[38;2;177;185;249m❯[6GHarness + many, growing over time[39m[59;1H[51;1H[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h]0;◑ Prompt engineering for LLM task[?2026h[H[3G[K[2C[1B[1mThe one real leak is the T-Box.[22m [38;2;177;185;249montology_terms[39m h[52Gs no scope[63Gcolumn,[71Gand[75G[38;2;177;185;249montology._lookup()[94G[39m([38;2;177;185;249msrc/arteries/ontology.py:196[39m)[125Gcaches[132Gthe[136Gentire[143Gtable[149Gin[152Ga[154Gprocess-global[169Gdict.[175GThe[179Gmoment[186Gyou[190Gload[195Ga[197Gtrading[205Gvocabulary,[217G[38;2;177;185;249mposition[39m,[227G[38;2;177;185;249mexposure[39m,[237Gand[241G[38;2;177;185;249msignal[248G[39mbecome[2C[1Bgroundable[14Ginside[21Gthe[25Gharness[33Gscope,[40Gand[44Ga[46Gcompile[54Gpass[59Gin[62G[38;2;177;185;249marteries[71G[39mwill[76Ghappily[84Gcanonicalize[97Gan[100Gunrelated[110Gword[115Gonto[120Ga[122Gfinance[130GURI.[135GThis[140Gmust[145Gbe[148Gfixed[154G[3mbefore[161G[23mLayer[167G2[169Gbelow,[176Gnot[180Gafter.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSecond,[11Gsmaller:[20G[38;2;177;185;249mgraph.upsert_entity[40G[39mderives[48G[38;2;177;185;249mscope_id[57G[39mas[60G[38;2;177;185;249mscope_for(project) or project[39m,[91Gso[94Gan[97Guntracked[107Grepo[112Gsilently[121Gmints[127Ga[129Gscope-of-one.[143GHarmless[152Gin[155Gisolation;[166Git's[171Gwhy[175Gthe[179Gdemo[184Gjunk[189Gexists.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BConditions that[19Gwould actually force [41G split lat[52Gr[54G— none of which hold now: a different Postgres ho[104Gt, a legally distinct ret[130Gnti[134Gn class ([38;2;177;185;249mcareer-ops[154G[39mh[156Glding[162Gcomp[167Gfigures, [38;2;177;185;249mTrading-Bot[39m holding [197Gccount data), or[214Gan[217Gembedding[227Gmodel[233Gchange,[241Gsince[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mEMBED_DIM[13G[39mis[16Gone[20Gcolumn[27Gwidth[33Gshared[40Gwith[45Gcapillaries.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mB. The ontology, in three layers[22m[K[2C[2BThe finding that drives the whole design: [1m0 of[50G23 entities are grounded.[22m You have 136 T-Box terms[101Gloaded[108G(PROV-O[116G101,[121GSKOS[126G32,[130Ga[132Gtest[137Gsource[144G3),[148Gand[152Gnot[156Gone[160Gof[163Gthem[168Gcan[172Gever[177Gmatch[183G[38;2;177;185;249mreranker.py[39m,[196G[38;2;177;185;249mpgvector[39m,[206G[38;2;177;185;249mdev-wip[39m,[215Gor[218G[38;2;177;185;249mMemoryFrame[39m.[231GPROV-O[238Gdescribes[248Glineage[2C[1B[3mbetween records[19G[23m—[21Gwhich[27Garteries[36Galready[44Gexpresses[54Gstructurally,[68Gas[71G[38;2;177;185;249mderived_from[84G[39mand[88G[38;2;177;185;249msupersedes[99G[39medges.[106GThe[110Gvocabulary[121Gyou[125Gloaded[132Gcovers[139Gthe[143Glayer[149Gthat[154Gdoesn't[162Gneed[167Gnaming,[175Gand[179Gleaves[186Gbare[191Gthe[195Glayer[201Gthat[206Gdoes.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mLayer 0 — lineage (loaded, keep, bind properly).[22m PROV-O[59Gbelongs[67Go[70G[3mpredicates[23m, not entities: [38;2;177;185;249mderived_from[39m→[38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasDerivedFrom[39m, [38;2;177;185;249msupersedes[39m→[38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasRevisionOf[39m, the compile run→[38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasGeneratedBy[39m. Note [38;2;177;185;249mmem[207Gry_edges.ontology_valid[231G[39mexists for exactly this[2C[1Band is never[16Gwritten by [38;2;177;185;249madd_[32Gdge()[38G[39m— the column is dead.[K[4C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mLayer 1 — the arteries core ([38;2;177;185;249mart:[39m), universal, binds 1:1 to existing columns so nothing migrates.[22m[K[2C[2B- [38;2;177;185;249mart:Claim[39m ⊃ Fact, Decision, Preference, Constraint → binds to [38;2;177;185;249mpersistent.kind[39m, whose four values already exist.[K[2C[1B- [38;2;177;185;249mart:Entity[39m ⊃ the current three kinds, with subclasses c[61Grried in [38;2;177;185;249montology[79Gclass[39m rather than a [100Gew column. The[115Glive[120Gdata[125Gshows[131Gthe[135Gthree[141Gkinds[147Gare[151Gtoo[155Gcoarse:[163G[38;2;177;185;249m/agent/route[176G[39m(an[180GHTTP[185Gendpoint)[195Gand[199G[38;2;177;185;249magent/route.py[214G[39m(the[219Gfile[224Gbehind[231Git)[235Gare[239Gtwo[243Gseparate[4C[1Bnodes[11Gboth[16Gtyped[22G[38;2;177;185;249mmodule[39m;[30G[38;2;177;185;249mdev-wip[38G[39m(a[41Ggit[45Gbranch)[53Gis[56Gtyped[62G[38;2;177;185;249mconcept[39m;[71G[38;2;177;185;249mArteries[39m,[81G[38;2;177;185;249mCapillaries[39m,[94G[38;2;177;185;249mHeart[39m,[101G[38;2;177;185;249mMarrow[108G[39mare[112Gtyped[118G[38;2;177;185;249mmodule[125G[39mwhen[130Gthey[135Gare[139Gprojects.[149GProposed[158Gsubclasses[169G—[171GSoftwareModule,[187GService,[196GDependency,[208GInterface,[219GArtifact,[229GConcept,[238GAgent/Person,[2C[1B  Metric, Environment.[K[2C[1B-[5GRelations[15Gworth[21Gadding[28Gto[31Gthe[35Gcurrent[43Gten:[48G[38;2;177;185;249mcauses[39m,[56G[38;2;177;185;249mapplies_to[67G[39m(constraint→entity),[88G[38;2;177;185;249minvalidated_by[103G[39m([38;2;177;185;249mprov:wasInvalidatedBy[126G[39m—[128Gyou[132Gtombstone[142Gwith[147G[38;2;177;185;249mvalid_until[159G[39mbut[163Gnever[169Grecord[176G[3mwhy[23m),[182G[38;2;177;185;249mmeasured_at[39m,[195G[38;2;177;185;249malternative_to[39m.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mLayer 2 — per-scope domain vocabularies, in SKOS.[53G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mharness[61G[39mgets the[70Gstack's[78Gown[82Gnouns.[89G[38;2;177;185;249mcareer-ops[100G[39mgets[105Grole/company/stage/comp-band.[135G[38;2;177;185;249mTrading-Bot[147G[39mgets[152Ginstrument/position/signal/d[181Gawdown.[189GMechanism:[200G[38;2;177;185;249montology_terms.source[222G[39malready[230Gexists,[238Gso[241Gthis[246Gis[249Gone[2C[1Bsmall table — [38;2;177;185;249montology_bindings(scope_id, source)[39m — plus a scope filter in [38;2;177;185;249m_lookup()[39m. Layers 0 and 1 bind to [38;2;177;185;249m*[39m.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mC. What it changes, per store[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B┌[16G┬[110G┬[247G┐[4C[1B  Layer[18G                  [37G  [40G        [49G   [53G        Today[112G         [122G        [131G [133G         [143G    [148G     [154G         [164G [166G     [172G    Aft[180Gr    [186G       [194G             [208G      [215G   [219G      [226G  [229G        [2C[1B├[16G┼[110G┼[247G┤[2C[1B│[5GRelational[16G│[18G[38;2;177;185;249mpersistent.kind[34G[39mis[37Gfree[42Gtext[47Gdefaulting[58Gto[61G[38;2;177;185;249m'fact'[39m;[69G147[73Gof[76G157[80Grows[85Gare[89G[38;2;177;185;249mfact[110G[39m│[112GKind[117Gconstrained[129Gto[132GLayer-1[140Gclasses;[149Gfine[154Gtype[159Gin[162G[38;2;177;185;249montology_class[247G[39m│[2C[1B├────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[K[2C[1B│ Graph [12G  [15G │ 23 e[23Gtities, 0 grounded; [38;2;177;185;249mancestors()[39m never r[63Gturns anything,[79Gso subclass expansion i[105Gnert │[112G[38;2;177;185;249mmetadata.ontology_ancestors[39m p[142Gpulates, and[155G[38;2;177;185;249mexpand()[39m's shared-ent[177Gty join reaches[193Ga[195Gclaim[201Gabout[207G[38;2;177;185;249mpgvector[216G[39mfrom[221Ga[223Gquery[229Gabout[235G[38;2;177;185;249mVectorStore[247G[39m│[2C[1B├────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────