 / module / dependency — today's three kinds. ~50 nodes total, very few false negatives, but every plan touching `arteries` trips every `arteries` constraint. Noise kills it fast.[1B[39m [3G[38;2;153;153;153m4.[39m Coarse nodes + locus qualifier[K[1B     [38;2;153;153;153mKeep[11Gcoarse no[21Ges,[25Gput the precise[41Gtar[45Ge[47G in `memory_edges.m[67Gtadata` (entity=`persistent`, locus=`kind column`). Free schema-wise, since the JSONB column exists — but locus strings never canonicalize, so they re-fragment the way raw names do.[2C[1B5. Type something.[1B──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[1B[39m  6.[6GChat[11Gabout[17Gthis[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select ·[19G↑/↓ to n[28Gvigate · Esc to [45Gancel[39m[K[59;1H[46;1H[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h]0;◐ Prompt engineering for LLM task[?2026h[H[38;2;153;153;153m● [39mUser[8Ganswered[17GClaude's[26Gquestions:[1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · At ~20 tracked repos, how should scopes be cut? This decides the entity namespace — and it's the expensive one to change later, since regrouping means re-keying entity nodes and re-deriving their edges. → Scopes should follow whatever group I [1B[39m     [38;2;153;153;153mdef[10Gne. Some[19Grepos are[29Gt[31Geir own scopes (only one rep[60G in group)[71Gwhile others[84Glik[88G har[93Gess contai[104G multiple[114Grepos (capillaries, arteries, heart,[151Gplexus, marrow noting I[175Ghaven't done more work [199Gn [202Geart, plexus and marrow yet) [39m[K[5C[1B[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39m[1mSettled:[12G[22mscope[18Gmembership[29Gstays[35Ghand-defined[48G—[50Gwhich[56Gis[59Galready[67Gexactly[75Gwhat[80G[38;2;177;185;249mart scope add[94G[39mdoes,[100Gso[10