ver.[2B [3G[1mOpen:[22m what actually counts as a conflict. This is the difference[68Gbetween[76Ga[78Gtool[83Gyou[87Gcheck[93Gand[97Ga[99Gtool[104Gyou[108Gmute.[2B[38;2;153;153;153m● [39mUser answered Claude's questions:[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should the system flag as a conflict worth interrupting you for? Each class you pick is a relation to build and a false-positive source to tune — picking several means ranking and dedup become mandatory, not optional. → Direct contradiction, [5C[1BConstraint violation[2C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39m[1mSettled:[22m two triggers only — [33Girect contradiction and[57Gconstra[65Gnt[68Gviolation. [38;2;177;185;249mcompetes_with[93G[39mis cu[99G from the[109Gdesign; [38;2;177;185;249mdepends_on[39m stays in the[141Gvocabulary[152Gbut never fires an[171Ginterrupt. That's[189Ga high-precision scope, and it makes constraint capt[242Gre[245Gthe[K[2C[1Bcritical pa[15Gh, since[24Ghalf your[34Gtriggers depe[48Gd on a claim ki[64Gd[66Gthat curre[77Gtly has one row.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mOpen:[9G[22mthe[13Ggranularity[25Gyour[30Gconstraints[42Gattach[49Gat.[53GBoth[58Gtriggers[67Gare[71Gentity-mediated,[88Gand[92Gyour[97Gown[101Gconstraints[113Gare[117Gphrased[125Gat[128Gwildly[135Gdifferent[145Glevels[152G—[154G[3m"arteries never imports capillaries' DB layer"[201G[23mis[204Gproject-and-subsystem,[227G[3m"never drop a fact the [2C[1Bontology doesn't recognise"[23m is concept-level, [3m"ids are UUIDs"[23m is[68Gcolumn-level. Pick[87Gon[90G fixe[97Glevel and half of[115Gthem[120Gbecome[127Gunattachable.[141GWorth[147Gnoting:[155Gyour[160Gextractor[170Gcurrently[180Gproduces[189G23[192Gentities[201Gacross[208G157[212Gclaims[219G—[221Groughly[229G0.15[234Gper[238Gclaim,[245Gwhere[2C[1Bentity[10Gextraction[21Gusually[29Gyields[36Gtwo[40Gto[43Gfive.[49GIt's[54Gunder-producing[70Gbadly[7