xus/heart and docs, things I plan out should also be taken into account. When conflicts arise, my goal is to be able to see them along with retrieved context for evidence, then I'll [2C[1B[39m   [38;2;153;153;153mdecide what design/feature to actually follow while you work on resolving implementation details to satisfy that"[39m[K[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39m[1mSettled — and this is the operating loop, stated cleanly:[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[2m▎[5G[22m[3mplexus/heart decompose goals → structured decisions + constraints land in the store, alongside ingested specs and your own planning turns → a later plan hits one of them → the system surfaces [1mthe conflict plus its evidence chain[22m → you pick the design[2C[1B[23m[2m▎[22m [3m→ I resolve the implementation to match.[23m[K[2B  Three things fo[19Glow immedia[31Gely. First,[43Gthe[47Ghuman[53Gis[56Gthe[60Gadjudicator,[73Gso[76Gthe[80Gsystem's[89Gjob[93Gis[96G[3mpresentation quality[23m,[118Gnot[122Gautomated[132Gresolution[143G—[145Gthe[149Gconflict[158Ghas[162Gto[165Garrive[172Gwith[177Gprovenance[188Gback[193Gto[196Gthe[200Gspec[205Gline[210Gor[213Gturn[218Gthat[223Gasserted[232Git,[236Gnot[240Gjust[245Gtwo[1B  sentences side by side. Second, your choice is itself a decision that has to be recorded, with the losing branch tombstoned by [38;2;177;185;249msupersedes[39m carrying a reason — otherwise the same conflict resurfaces next month. Third, "things I plan out should be taken[K[2C[1Binto account" splits the[28Gclaim[34Gspace[40Galong[46Gan[49Gaxis[54Gthe[58Gcurrent[66Gmodel[72Gdoesn't[80Ghave:[86G[1mprospective[98G[22mclaims[105G(what[111Gmust[116Gor[119Gwill[124Gbe[127Gtrue[132G—[134Gplans,[141Gconstraints,[154Gdecisions)[165Gversus[172G[1mretrospective[186G[22mones[191G(what[197Gis[200Gor[203Gwas[207Gtrue[212G—[214Gthe[218G147[222Gfacts).[230GConflict[239Gdetection[249Gonly[2C[1Bever[8Gruns[13Gagainst[21Gthe[25Gprospective[37Gset.[42GThat[47Gsingle[54Gdistinction[66Gis[69Gwhat[74Gkeeps[80Gnarration[90Gout[94Gof[97Git[100Gwithout[108Gneeding[116Gthe[120Gcompiler[129Gto[132Gbe[135Gclever.[1B[K[2C[1B[1mOpen:[22m what actually counts as a conflict. This[50Gis[53Gthe d[59Gfference between a tool you check and[97Ga[99Gtool[104Gyou[108Gmute.[2B[38;2;153;153;153m● [39mUser answered C[20Gude's q[28Gestions:[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should the system flag as a conflict worth interrupting you for? Each class you pick is a relation to build and a false-positive source to tune — picking several means ranking and dedup become mandatory, not optional. → Direct contradiction, [2C[1B[39m   [38;2;153;153;153mConstraint violation[39m[K[2B[38;2;255;255;255m●[39m [1mSettled:[22m two triggers only — direct[39Gcontradiction[53Gand[57Gconstraint[68Gviolation.[79G[38;2;177;185;249mcompetes_with[93G[39mis[96Gcut[100Gfrom[105Gthe[109Gdesign;[117G[38;2;177;185;249mdepends_on[128G[39mstays[134Gin[137Gthe[141Gvocabulary[152Gbut[156Gnever[162Gfires[168Gan[171Ginterrupt.[182GThat's[189Ga[191Ghigh-precision[206Gscope,[213Gand[217Git[220Gmakes[226Gconstraint[237Gcapture[245Gthe[1B  critical path, since half your triggers depend on a claim kind that currently has one row.[K[2B [3G[1mOpen:[22m the granularity[25Gyour constraints attach at. Both triggers are entity-mediated, and your own constraints [114Gre phrased at wildly different[145Glevels —[154G[3m"arteries never imports capillaries' DB layer"[23m is proj[209Gct-and-subsystem,[227G[3m"never drop a fact the [23m[K[2C[1B[3montology doesn't recognise"[23m is concept-level, [3m"ids are UUIDs"[23m is column-level. Pick one f[93Gxed level and half of [116Ghem become unattac[135Gable. Worth noting: your[160Gextractor currently produces 23[192Gentities acros[208G157 claims — roughly 0.15 pe